\f1\fs22 When the driver saw the affliction of her belly, he strode to assist and took her by the elbow.\
\'93I\'92m fine, thank you,\'94 Sarah said.\
The driver went ahead and opened the back door and hoped it was wide enough.\
Back behind the wheel, the driver asked, \'93Airborne Mountains Cosmetic & Maternity, ma\'92am?\'94\
\'93What?\'94 Sarah checked. \'93Do I look like I need a face-lift?\'94\
The driver nodded at her bulging middle. \'93I\'92m sorry ma\'92am. I only meant\'85 your condition.\'94\
\'93My condition is mint,\'94 Sarah countered testily. \'93Take me up to the residence.\'94\
The driver tried not to blink. \'93To the Shakti residence, ma\'92am?\'94\
\'93What? You tried to carry me to the car a minute ago; now you won\'92t take me to the house?\'94\
The driver thought about his retirement plan. \'93Do you have an appointment?\'94\
\'93Appointment? Eloise isn\'92t my doctor.\'94\
\'93No, ma\'92am.\'94\
\'93Are you driving, or are you going to carry me?\'94\
